    "body": "### Contact Details (e.g. Tox ID or email)\n\n_No response_\n\n### Feature Description\n\nTitle is simple enough, qTox should strip exif data for privacy reasons.\n\n### Contribution\n\n- [ ] I would like to contribute to this feature",
    "closed_at": null,
    "closed_by": null,
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Good idea, but it should be optional!\nMaybe some people use it only with their families or use it for work and need the metadata to be there.\nI would have no problem with the stripping being on by default and then have an option in the setttings to turn it off for certain people.",
